From 99a4ddae98348264309bb348d86981846c6d6acd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DADAO-v5 <dadao-v5@example.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 02:17:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] target/dadao: Split translate.c into insn_trans/
 subdirectory

Pure refactoring: move all 256 trans_* functions from translate.c into
10 categorized .c.inc files under target/dadao/insn_trans/:

  trans_arith.c.inc       (90)  - add/sub/mul/div/rem + float ops
  trans_compare.c.inc     (13)  - cmp.* + float comparison
  trans_logic.c.inc       (16)  - and/or/xor/xnor/andn
  trans_shift.c.inc       (24)  - shr/shl
  trans_extend.c.inc      (16)  - ext.*
  trans_cond_assign.c.inc (10)  - cs.*
  trans_imm.c.inc          (8)  - set.ow/set.zw/or.w/andn.w
  trans_block.c.inc        (8)  - rd2rd/rd2rb/rb2rd/rb2rb/rd2ra/ra2rd
  trans_mem.c.inc         (46)  - ld/st/ldm/stm/lr/sc
  trans_ctrl.c.inc        (25)  - br/jump/call/ret/rela/swym/illi/fence

translate.c retains: helpers, macros, gen_intermediate_code, and
10 #include statements for the .c.inc files.

No functional change. insn.decode unchanged.
